our prompts in many ways as well.

127
00:06:29.455 --> 00:06:32.058
For example, here
you'll notice a for loop.

128
00:06:32.058 --> 00:06:35.661
We use these templates with a component
called the prompt builder.

129
00:06:35.895 --> 00:06:39.399
And when we have this type of prompts
well essentially saying

130
00:06:39.399 --> 00:06:44.399
