133
00:06:51.277 --> 00:06:55.982
Jinja allows for different things like
if statements for loops, and so on too.

134
00:06:55.982 --> 00:07:00.982
It comes with a bunch of default functions
like truncation, lowercase, etc.

135
00:07:01.487 --> 00:07:04.424
as well. It's a pretty nice tool
to be able to use.

